+   *
+   * Some volumes are left alone. Provided filesystems, media views and
+   * archives have no size worth reporting, which is the same set the gear menu
+   * declines to describe. Drive is left out too, but for a different reason:
+   * its figure comes from a quota API rather than from the filesystem, it is a
